					"loading": "lazy",
					"decoding": "async",
					"title": "Couples Getaway",
					"desc": "Some places are simply better experienced together. From sundowners in the bush to private wine tastings in the Cape, every moment of the Umoya journey is designed to be shared, in settings that stay with you long after you return home."
				},
				{
					"role": "listitem",
					"notes": "\n          <!-- ★ SWAP: World Wonders image (Victoria Falls / Chobe — TBD) -->\n          ",
					"src": "https://umoyaafrikatours.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/optimized/umoya_compressed_img1777576366.jpeg",
					"alt": "Extending the journey to Africa's natural wonders",
					"loading": "lazy",
					"decoding": "async",
					"title": "World Wonders",
					"desc": "For those who want to go further and stay longer, extend your journey into Africa's most breathtaking destinations. Victoria Falls and the vast elephant herds of Chobe are waiting, and we take care of everything to get you there."
				},
				{
					"role": "listitem",
					"notes": "\n          <!-- ★ SWAP: Safari image -->\n          ",
					"src": "https://umoyaafrikatours.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/optimized/umoya_compressed_img001238.jpeg",
					"alt": "Safari game drive in the Sabi Sand",
					"loading": "lazy",
					"decoding": "async",
					"title": "Safari",
					"desc": "The African bush is unlike anywhere else on earth, and the Sabi Sand is one of the finest places to experience it. With expert guides, open vehicles, and the freedom to follow the animals wherever they go, the Big Five come to you on your own terms."
				},
				{
					"role": "listitem",
					"notes": "\n          <!-- ★ SWAP: Winelands image -->\n          ",
					"src": "https://umoyaafrikatours.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/optimized/umoya_compressed_img166276458.jpeg",
					"alt": "Wine tasting in the Cape Winelands",
					"loading": "lazy",
					"decoding": "async",
					"title": "Winelands",
